## Look-ahead depth limit from the stated solution length (World-Conventions L16-045): "The solution has 24 steps",
## above the library default of 12, so iterative deepening may search 24 steps deep.
sp {eight-men-raft*elaborate*flags*max-evaluation-depth
   (state <s> ^superstate nil ^name eight-men-raft)
-->
   (<s> ^flag-override <f>)
   (<f> ^max-evaluation-depth 24)
}
